---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import storyImage from '../../assets/images/about/story.png';
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../ui/Eyebrow.astro';
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
---

<section class="py-17 md:py-24" id="story">
  <div class="wrap grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-18">
    <div>
      <Eyebrow>Our Story</Eyebrow>
      <h2 class="mb-3.5">Built on Experience, Trust and Hands-On Service</h2>
      <p class="mb-3.5">
        With over 10 years in business, ARYA Heating &amp; Cooling is built on experience, trust, and hands-on service.
        Our Master Licensed Technicians focus on quality work and reliable emergency HVAC to keep your home comfortable
        year-round.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-7.5">
        From urgent repairs to routine maintenance, we look after homes and businesses in Ashburn and across Northern
        Virginia. More than 10,000 completed jobs later, we still treat every call the same way: show up, find the real
        problem and fix it properly.
      </p>
      <Button quote>Get Free Quote <Icon name="arrow" /></Button>
    </div>

    <div class="relative pr-7 pb-7">
      <div
        class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 h-[70%] w-[62%] rounded-3xl bg-linear-135 from-brand to-navy-light"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
      </div>
      <Image
        src={storyImage}
        alt="Heating equipment installed by ARYA Heating & Cooling"
        widths={[320, storyImage.width]}
        sizes="(min-width: 901px) 520px, 100vw"
        class="relative aspect-[4/3.4] w-full rounded-3xl object-cover"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
